{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2019-05", "window": 4, "start_date": 1558656000, "end_date": 1559347199, "month_true_total": 877, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:58:59 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "50982162", "author": {"steamid": "76561198338396670", "personaname": "JoeDaBro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198338396670/", "num_games_owned": 145, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 150894, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20886, "last_played": 1781932509, "avatar": "2c5c32d3aa340e1caa5bfcdd87366079da4dc9ff"}, "language": "english", "review": "Probably one of my most played games ever. While I am sure you can all see that I have a mediocre amount of time on this game, I am also sure you all can agree with me that time is only one factor of understanding and playing this game.\n\nThis is a game where you can fight as a being known as the warframe, often referred to as a tenno. Weild your weapons, fully modded and customized to your liking, and customize your frame to look and play like anything from a walking pin cushion to an unstoppable force. Fight off the armies of the Corpus and the Grineer, and something more sinister? Discover the story of this world, and write your own story as you go!\n\nBuild up your arsenal by constructing more frames and weapons, farming materials, .........Hell, ADOPT A PUPPY.\n\nThere is no huge ending goal to get to, the only goals are the ones you set for yourself, so try not to \"finish\" the game, have fun with it!\n\nLastly, one of the best parts is the fact that this community remains to be one of the most newbie-friendly that I have seen. Never be afraid to ask a question, I can bet you a seasoned veteran has no problem showing the new guy around :)\n\n10/10 still going strong!", "timestamp_created": 1559342357, "timestamp_updated": 1559342357, "voted_up": true, "vot